it=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2a772cdab7bf874344ed94fb488005a1 3x"}, "body": "Mr. Shirafuji, I am very sorry for the inconvenience. I had to withdraw your request due to several mishaps, and I apologize for any inconvenience caused. I am also sorry that it was after the deadline of the campaign after all.\nI am deeply grateful for your kind consideration and will submit the request again. Thank you very much for your continued support.\n\nI would like to request an illustration of Vtuber \"Asahi Asahina\" as fan art. If possible, I would like to be allowed to use it in my activities....\n\nHere is the address of our Twitter account @Asahi_jang\n\nAs I said before, I am ashamed to say that I have been dreaming of having you draw in your unique and charming style that I cannot hope to find anywhere else... This is just an order out of the blue, and I would be very grateful if you could listen to me.\nWe would be very grateful if you could hear us out.", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@4624/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1507753, "client_id": 190627, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c6226587/uploads/origins/9338185b-f9f9-4b3d-8904-d61592213871?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=705249306192f60564fc8002ab538fd4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c6226587/uploads/origins/9338185b-f9f9-4b3d-8904-d61592213871?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=705249306192f60564fc8002ab538fd4, https://si.imgix.net/c6226587/uploads/origins/9338185b-f9f9-4b3d-8904-d61592213871?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0c11326e6f32de241eead0b20a3bfde5 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c6226587/uploads/origins/9338185b-f9f9-4b3d-8904-d61592213871?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit